                <a class="card-link" href="thesis.pdf" target="_blank">
                  <span class="card-title">Penn Honors Thesis</span>
                  <span class="card-description">A PPE honors thesis exploring the democratic tradition of excellence in arts and culture through the Cold War, and its direct impacts on the use of celebrity in the 2024 Presidential Election.</span>
                </a>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a class="card-link" href="Bronk -- Argument Analysis.pdf" target="_blank">
                  <span class="card-title">Constitutional Law Voting Rights Jurisprudence</span>
